'      Where beauty meets your everyday glow.',
'      Discover a world of colour, care and confidence',
unistr('      with Glamor\00E9.'),
'    </p>',
'',
'    <a href="f?p=&APP_ID.:1:&APP_SESSION."',
'       style="',
'         display: inline-block;',
